#: templates/footer.html:20
msgid ""
"This SDA-hosted version is an unofficial modified fork maintained by <strong"
" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\">Sebastian Grof</strong>. The official "
"Tabbycat project is available at <strong><a href=\"https://tabbycat-"
"debate.org/\">tabbycat-debate.org</a></strong>. See <a "
"href=\"https://github.com/sebastian-"
"grof/tabbycat/blob/develop/MODIFICATIONS.md\">Modifications</a> and <a "
"href=\"https://github.com/sebastian-grof/tabbycat\">Source Code</a>."
